WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.425 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.105 --> 01:42.825
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

5
01:42.905 --> 01:45.305
Sir, to get this person out of the manor,

6
01:45.385 --> 01:46.905
we took advantage of the Nuo troupe.

7
01:46.985 --> 01:49.385
While they were hauling their drum boxes,

8
01:49.465 --> 01:51.665
we slipped out of the Duke's Residence.

9
01:51.745 --> 01:54.585
Good work. A generous reward awaits.

10
01:54.665 --> 01:55.825
Thank you, Sir.

11
01:57.425 --> 01:58.825
Lady Lu,

12
01:59.585 --> 02:03.145
despite your careful calculations, you still end up in my hands.

13
02:03.945 --> 02:04.985
Well?

14
02:05.985 --> 02:09.225
It must feel bad being trapped inside a box.

15
02:11.625 --> 02:12.785
Calm down.

16
02:13.745 --> 02:16.145
I know you are a fake.

17
02:16.225 --> 02:20.185
As long as you obey and help me out with something,

18
02:20.265 --> 02:23.585
I will send you back unharmed.

19
02:25.985 --> 02:26.825
Sir!

20
02:29.225 --> 02:30.425
I don't care who you are.

21
02:30.505 --> 02:32.065
Release me immediately!

22
02:32.145 --> 02:36.385
Any later, I'll tear you limb from limb and mince you to a pulp.

23
02:43.585 --> 02:44.985
Who are you?

24
02:45.585 --> 02:47.345
How dare you act so arrogantly?

25
02:48.945 --> 02:51.265
You kidnapped me without knowing who I am?

26
02:53.305 --> 02:55.465
Old Madam Wei of the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence is my…

27
02:59.745 --> 03:00.705
God-grandmother.

28
03:02.225 --> 03:04.865
She treats me like her own granddaughter.

29
03:04.945 --> 03:07.065
If you don't send me back safely,

30
03:07.145 --> 03:08.505
I'll report you to the officials and have you executed!

31
03:09.105 --> 03:10.345
God-grandmother?

32
03:13.665 --> 03:14.865
I think

33
03:16.385 --> 03:17.905
she is your actual grandmother.

34
03:24.905 --> 03:26.945
-What nonsense are you talking about? -What?

35
03:27.025 --> 03:29.865
The fake is pretending to be a noble lady, and the real one is a shrew?

36
03:31.905 --> 03:35.585
What in the world is the Wei family trying to achieve?

37
03:38.145 --> 03:39.305
Who do you think you are?

38
03:39.385 --> 03:42.465
Whether I'm real or a fake is none of your business!

39
03:42.545 --> 03:43.385
Let me out!

40
03:44.585 --> 03:46.585
What a crazy woman.

41
03:46.665 --> 03:48.305
Let me out!

42
03:48.385 --> 03:50.865
Help! Someone!

43
03:50.945 --> 03:52.705
She's worse than the fake one.

44
03:52.785 --> 03:53.905
Hurry and shut her mouth!

45
03:53.985 --> 03:56.465
Someone! Help!

46
03:56.545 --> 03:58.585
Don't touch me!

47
03:59.545 --> 04:00.785
-Don't touch me! -Rao!

48
04:01.825 --> 04:02.665
Get lost!

49
04:08.745 --> 04:09.585
Get up.

50
04:12.225 --> 04:15.465
A mere merchant dares to trespass on my residence?

51
04:16.305 --> 04:17.785
Capture them immediately!

52
04:18.624 --> 04:19.465
Who dares?

53
04:29.385 --> 04:31.425
I just left the city and came across Grandmother's convoy.

54
04:32.145 --> 04:35.665
Only then did I realize she rushed back to celebrate the Duchess' birthday.

55
04:35.745 --> 04:37.265
Unfortunately, a storm held her her up

56
04:37.345 --> 04:38.345
and delayed her journey.

57
04:40.385 --> 04:42.225
I failed to welcome my esteemed guest.

58
04:42.305 --> 04:44.425
Lady Shou'an, please forgive me.

59
04:45.025 --> 04:47.425
Enough. Cut the pleasantries.

60
04:47.945 --> 04:49.785
I don't like fake, pretentious behavior.

61
04:50.785 --> 04:53.385
I'm exhausted from the arduous journey.

62
04:53.905 --> 04:56.225
I have no patience for your idle chatter.

63
04:56.305 --> 04:58.305
I'm taking her away.

64
05:02.185 --> 05:05.345
Lady Shou'an, I can't stop you from leaving.

65
05:06.145 --> 05:09.145
However, this woman pretended to be a noble's wife.

66
05:09.225 --> 05:11.625
She acted suspiciously, and her identity is a mystery.

67
05:11.705 --> 05:13.185
We cannot let her walk away.

68
05:17.945 --> 05:19.825
Who am I?

69
05:28.185 --> 05:30.145
Surely, you are His Majesty's wet nurse.

70
05:30.745 --> 05:31.985
No commoner has ever been admitted to such nobility.

71
05:32.065 --> 05:36.505
But you are the first wet nurse to be granted a fief and a title in this era.

72
05:36.585 --> 05:39.505
Everyone in the capital knows who you are.

73
05:41.465 --> 05:45.105
I thought you were so blind as not to recognize me.

74
05:46.145 --> 05:49.665
I raised His Majesty all on my own.

75
05:50.345 --> 05:53.625
Even your father's horse carriage has to show respect

76
05:53.705 --> 05:56.545
and make way when it sees me.

77
05:57.505 --> 05:58.625
You?

78
06:00.145 --> 06:02.345
Barely out of the cradle

79
06:02.865 --> 06:04.505
and you dare speak up to me?

80
06:05.585 --> 06:08.465
If you don't let her go, believe it or not,

81
06:08.545 --> 06:11.425
I'll burn all your manors to the ground.

82
06:11.505 --> 06:15.465
Next, I'll accuse the Hans of bullying a lone old woman!

83
06:16.505 --> 06:20.825
Let's see if His Majesty is going to seek justice for me.

84
06:29.985 --> 06:31.625
Who else dares to stop me?

85
06:43.505 --> 06:44.585
Let's go.

86
06:53.065 --> 06:55.985
Keep a close eye on Duke's Residence and Xianzhuang for me.

87
06:56.065 --> 06:58.425
I don't care if she's real or fake.

88
06:59.305 --> 07:03.665
I must find real proof before I deal with her.

89
07:04.665 --> 07:05.505
Yes.

90
07:14.945 --> 07:16.625
Who are you, really?

91
07:28.105 --> 07:30.705
Nuo dancers might be able to communicate with the supernatural,

92
07:30.785 --> 07:32.225
but their income is a pittance.

93
07:32.825 --> 07:34.185
Dancers are not allowed to show their faces.

94
07:34.785 --> 07:37.225
Those who practice it usually come from poor families.

95
07:37.305 --> 07:39.425
How is it possible that a daughter of an earl

96
07:40.305 --> 07:41.865
knows the Nuo dance?

97
07:43.705 --> 07:46.105
Because doing the Nuo dance at the temple ritual every year

98
07:46.185 --> 07:48.065
earns me an extra 30 coins.

99
07:49.625 --> 07:52.505
The types of dance popular in the capital are light and elegant,

100
07:53.065 --> 07:55.625
but my maternal grandmother thinks it lacks strength and vigor.

101
07:56.585 --> 07:58.385
She likes watching Nuo dance and Sword dance.

102
07:58.465 --> 08:00.505
Nuo dance steps are easy to learn.

103
08:01.025 --> 08:06.145
Longsword dance or Dagger play are something I dare not perform.

104
08:06.745 --> 08:09.945
Back then, my birth mother could sing and dance well.

105
08:10.025 --> 08:11.665
She never forgets a song she learns,

106
08:11.745 --> 08:13.305
but often draws criticism.

107
08:14.105 --> 08:15.625
Grandmother didn't like it either,

108
08:15.705 --> 08:17.545
so she never allows me to perform.

109
08:18.825 --> 08:20.065
That was why I didn't tell you.

110
08:27.825 --> 08:30.425
I only performed it in front of others for this birthday banquet.

111
08:31.345 --> 08:34.225
My Lord, why do you doubt me?

112
08:35.745 --> 08:39.305
When you met Xie Hualou in the past, you'd go mad.

113
08:39.904 --> 08:42.465
You'd use the world's most despicable schemes

114
08:42.545 --> 08:45.105
just to defeat and humiliate your enemy.

115
08:45.865 --> 08:49.025
Tonight, even if you were backed into a corner by the Xies,

116
08:50.145 --> 08:52.225
you were still acting calm and collected.

117
08:53.345 --> 08:57.145
Wei Rao, when did you get so generous?

118
08:57.825 --> 08:59.305
All the elders were present.

119
09:00.865 --> 09:02.465
I must consider the greater good.

120
09:02.545 --> 09:04.665
You had a secret chat with your cousin Huo.

121
09:06.065 --> 09:07.145
What did you two talk about?

122
09:07.945 --> 09:09.465
Private matters between relatives.

123
09:09.545 --> 09:10.465
I was afraid Grandmother…

124
09:10.545 --> 09:12.465
Why did you get angry and toss the Hans' gift

125
09:12.545 --> 09:14.065
and ignore the guests?

126
09:14.585 --> 09:16.345
You were away from the banquet,

127
09:16.425 --> 09:18.945
yet the servants saw Qi Zhongkai send you back to the banquet.

128
09:19.025 --> 09:21.265
Your cousin left the banquet rudely.

129
09:21.345 --> 09:22.305
Why was that?

130
09:26.025 --> 09:27.585
-I… -I want to hear the truth.

131
09:32.825 --> 09:34.305
Compared to when I first met you,

132
09:35.185 --> 09:37.705
your temperament, manner, and conduct are all different.

133
09:38.865 --> 09:42.665
Within two months, how could there be such a big difference?

134
09:43.385 --> 09:44.505
Who are you?

135
09:48.065 --> 09:50.825
Tell me. Who in the world are you?

136
10:17.345 --> 10:18.545
What are you doing?

137
10:22.985 --> 10:24.065
Who am I?

138
10:25.945 --> 10:26.905
My Lord.

139
10:28.785 --> 10:30.185
Tell me who I am.

140
10:31.625 --> 10:33.865
Wei Rao, put on your clothes immediately.

141
10:43.145 --> 10:45.945
Even if I'm standing in front of you with all my clothes removed,

142
10:46.025 --> 10:47.745
you won't spare me a second glance.

143
10:55.025 --> 10:57.105
I am your wife who disgusts you.

144
11:14.785 --> 11:15.665
Lu Zhuo!

145
11:25.785 --> 11:27.665
As the heir, you need a wife who is dignified,

146
11:28.185 --> 11:29.585
gracious, gentle and virtuous.

147
11:30.265 --> 11:31.985
I changed myself for you.

148
11:32.705 --> 11:34.185
I changed my temperament.

149
11:35.145 --> 11:37.385
I spent my efforts organizing the banquet.

150
11:38.905 --> 11:41.065
I showed myself and performed in front of everyone

151
11:41.945 --> 11:45.585
just to win your favor.

152
11:53.385 --> 11:54.345
What about you?

153
11:55.465 --> 11:57.465
You sat there,

154
11:59.345 --> 12:02.385
and watched as I endured the pain, barely able to stand.

155
12:02.465 --> 12:05.385
You never said a word of concern.

156
12:05.465 --> 12:08.025
Instead, you suspected and questioned me.

157
12:11.665 --> 12:12.505
Who am I?

158
12:15.865 --> 12:17.705
Tell me who I am.

159
12:18.305 --> 12:20.785
I'm a fool who gave my heart to the wrong person!

160
12:33.505 --> 12:34.345
My Lord, remember.

161
12:35.385 --> 12:39.305
What I said to General Qi and my conversation with my cousin

162
12:39.385 --> 12:40.625
are my family matters.

163
12:43.105 --> 12:44.825
We'll only be married for a year.

164
12:44.905 --> 12:45.945
You are not my husband.

165
12:46.025 --> 12:47.025
Who I meet is none of your business.

166
12:48.265 --> 12:49.745
A year from now, we will part ways.

167
12:50.585 --> 12:52.465
I don't care who you'd marry.

168
12:52.545 --> 12:53.825
You should leave me alone as well.

169
12:54.425 --> 12:55.345
From now on,

170
12:56.425 --> 13:00.145
No prying, no digging, never enter my room for no reason.

171
13:00.945 --> 13:03.065
Otherwise, I'll pack up and return home immediately.

172
13:03.145 --> 13:04.785
You can explain it to Old Madam yourself.

173
13:05.505 --> 13:06.345
Get out!

174
13:07.465 --> 13:08.425
I didn't mean to offend you.

175
13:08.505 --> 13:09.825
Listen to me…

176
13:31.585 --> 13:32.465
My Lord.

177
13:35.425 --> 13:36.425
She is ill?

178
13:36.945 --> 13:38.145
Why didn't you get the physician?

179
13:38.225 --> 13:39.865
Forgive me, My Lord.

180
13:39.945 --> 13:41.505
Madam was busy on the banquet for days

181
13:41.585 --> 13:42.505
and felt a sudden pain in her stomach.

182
13:43.105 --> 13:44.105
She was worried that others might know

183
13:44.185 --> 13:46.305
and thought she was too weak to carry out the task.

184
13:46.385 --> 13:48.225
She doesn't want to cause you trouble,

185
13:48.305 --> 13:49.585
so I was not allowed to speak about it.

186
13:51.265 --> 13:52.825
-Jiede. -Yes.

187
13:52.905 --> 13:54.065
Take my slip

188
13:54.585 --> 13:56.425
and call Physician Yang from the palace who excels at treating stomach pains.

189
13:57.025 --> 13:58.105
Yes, My Lord.

190
14:05.985 --> 14:08.425
XIANZHUANG

191
14:08.505 --> 14:10.825
Tell me. What actually happened?

192
14:10.905 --> 14:12.305
Maternal Grandmother.

193
14:13.665 --> 14:16.065
I made a mistake as a clueless child

194
14:16.665 --> 14:19.505
and was banished from the family by Grandmother.

195
14:20.185 --> 14:22.065
I have nowhere to go.

196
14:22.145 --> 14:23.945
Maternal Grandmother,

197
14:24.025 --> 14:29.105
please pity me for being a lonely orphan and take me in.

198
14:29.185 --> 14:30.385
Don't chase me away.

199
14:30.985 --> 14:33.945
That old woman from the Wei family expelled you?

200
14:34.945 --> 14:36.585
How cruel.

201
14:37.185 --> 14:38.985
While her decision might be justified,

202
14:39.065 --> 14:40.945
she is still a descendant of the family after all.

203
14:41.465 --> 14:43.625
Old Madam Wei was too harsh.

204
14:45.585 --> 14:48.065
Maternal Grandmother, please stand up for Rao.

205
14:49.025 --> 14:50.105
If that's what really happened,

206
14:50.185 --> 14:55.425
I'll march straight to the Weis and give them what they deserve

207
14:55.505 --> 14:56.385
but…

208
14:58.705 --> 14:59.545
But why?

209
15:00.505 --> 15:02.025
Why did she become so livid

210
15:02.105 --> 15:03.585
that she kicked out her own granddaughter?

211
15:04.545 --> 15:06.825
You are the heir's wife.

212
15:06.905 --> 15:08.105
What makes her think she could kick you out?

213
15:12.385 --> 15:14.225
Dowager Lady, Old Madam Wei is here.

214
15:14.905 --> 15:16.145
Nice timing.

215
15:17.185 --> 15:18.985
Rao, leave for now.

216
15:19.825 --> 15:20.705
I…

217
15:21.625 --> 15:23.025
Be patient.

218
15:23.105 --> 15:24.185
Maternal Grandmother knows what to do.

219
15:30.545 --> 15:32.145
What a rare guest.

220
15:33.385 --> 15:37.865
The last time we had a peaceful conversation

221
15:37.945 --> 15:40.545
was probably more than a decade ago.

222
15:41.425 --> 15:45.385
It was seventeen years ago, the twenty-third of the last month.

223
15:45.905 --> 15:47.025
I will never forget.

224
15:47.785 --> 15:49.585
It was the Little New Year.

225
15:50.105 --> 15:53.305
Every household was cleaning and paying respects to the Kitchen God.

226
15:54.465 --> 15:56.185
After the hour of Wu,

227
15:56.865 --> 16:00.985
my son's coffin was carried into my residence's gates.

228
16:01.785 --> 16:05.905
My second son was stubborn and knew what he wanted.

229
16:05.985 --> 16:09.585
I searched throughout the capital

230
16:09.665 --> 16:13.305
to finally find a noble lady for him to marry.

231
16:13.385 --> 16:17.425
However, he'd rather be flogged 40 times

232
16:17.505 --> 16:20.145
just to refuse the marriage and marry your daughter instead.

233
16:21.225 --> 16:23.385
Back then, I didn't stop him.

234
16:24.025 --> 16:26.145
Later, it became my greatest resentment.

235
16:26.225 --> 16:27.945
Time has passed.

236
16:28.025 --> 16:31.825
After so long, why are you bringing this up?

237
16:31.905 --> 16:35.185
When your daughter, Zhou, married into my household,

238
16:35.985 --> 16:39.025
he treated her with care.

239
16:39.705 --> 16:42.265
Zhou was good at dancing and music.

240
16:42.345 --> 16:46.065
My son searched all over the capital for famous scores.

241
16:46.145 --> 16:49.185
Zhou was laughed at because of her modest background.

242
16:49.265 --> 16:52.505
My son fought on the battlefield to get her a title.

243
16:53.105 --> 16:56.545
My second son was born handsome and courageous.

244
16:56.625 --> 16:58.465
He was skilled in both the literary and martial arts.

245
16:58.545 --> 17:00.185
Everyone praised him.

246
17:00.265 --> 17:02.225
He was the pride of my life.

247
17:03.225 --> 17:06.345
But not long after he passed away,

248
17:06.905 --> 17:10.025
the woman he loved most abandoned him.

249
17:10.704 --> 17:16.184
She abandoned her young daughter and went away to seek someone better.

250
17:16.704 --> 17:17.745
I hate it.

251
17:18.265 --> 17:20.625
I hate that daughter of yours, Zhou.

252
17:20.704 --> 17:23.065
I hate you, you old, shameless woman who fawns over the powerful.

253
17:23.145 --> 17:25.905
I hate everyone in your household.

254
17:26.585 --> 17:29.585
It's because of you that my son, who gave his life serving his country,

255
17:29.665 --> 17:31.985
is still mocked even after death.

256
17:32.505 --> 17:34.345
They laughed at him and called him an idiot and a fool.

257
17:34.945 --> 17:40.225
His death brought your daughter wealth, honor, and favor.

258
17:40.305 --> 17:44.025
He helped your household gain fame, and power.

259
17:44.905 --> 17:47.745
You even harmed my granddaughter.

260
17:47.825 --> 17:49.705
She was afraid to go out and show herself to others

261
17:49.785 --> 17:52.425
from a young age.

262
17:52.505 --> 17:54.745
It's only right for a widow to remarry.

263
17:54.825 --> 17:56.905
One must live one's own life.

264
17:56.985 --> 17:59.505
Why are you so hung up on other people's opinions?

265
17:59.585 --> 18:02.265
You are the one who is stubborn and close-minded.

266
18:02.345 --> 18:03.865
Yes. I am close-minded.

267
18:04.665 --> 18:07.545
Your daughter only cared about her own glory

268
18:07.625 --> 18:12.745
and ignored the future life and reputation of her infant daughter.

269
18:13.345 --> 18:17.065
If my second son hadn't sacrificed his life to save the Lus,

270
18:17.145 --> 18:21.225
did you think Rao could marry into the Lu household now?

271
18:21.825 --> 18:24.745
Look around the capital.

272
18:24.825 --> 18:26.905
None of the educated families

273
18:26.985 --> 18:29.585
dare to marry a daughter of your Zhou family.

274
18:29.665 --> 18:31.985
Do you also want my granddaughter

275
18:32.065 --> 18:36.185
to disgrace herself and marry a lowly merchant?

276
18:42.105 --> 18:43.625
You can remain scornful as much as you want

277
18:44.225 --> 18:46.425
but you shouldn't neglect Rao.

278
18:47.585 --> 18:49.625
She was almost kidnapped.

279
18:50.225 --> 18:53.345
Thankfully, she is blessed.

280
18:53.425 --> 18:56.705
Otherwise, her fate would still be unknown.

281
18:56.785 --> 18:58.265
If anyone should harbor resentment, it's me.

282
18:58.345 --> 19:02.545
I resent myself for being so soft-hearted and tolerant.

283
19:02.625 --> 19:07.185
I should've brought Rao home so she wouldn't be neglected by you.

284
19:09.185 --> 19:13.665
I swear in the name of Heaven and my late son.

285
19:13.745 --> 19:17.065
I've treated Rao the best I could.

286
19:17.585 --> 19:19.865
I might have spoiled her.

287
19:19.945 --> 19:24.505
That is why she acted without a care and committed a grave mistake.

288
19:25.225 --> 19:29.665
She almost cost the lives of everyone in the family.

289
19:32.145 --> 19:35.465
What did she do?

290
19:36.425 --> 19:37.985
Ask her yourself.

291
19:38.665 --> 19:41.545
However, I hope all of you remember this.

292
19:42.585 --> 19:46.385
Rao is my granddaughter whom I raised myself.

293
19:46.465 --> 19:48.785
I gave her everything I had.

294
19:48.865 --> 19:51.945
What everyone else says means nothing.

295
19:52.625 --> 19:56.865
The one I say is my own, that's my real granddaughter.

296
19:56.945 --> 19:59.025
Doesn't matter whose support she's got.

297
19:59.105 --> 20:03.425
Anyone who dares cause trouble here

298
20:03.505 --> 20:07.785
and drag the Wei family into disgrace again

299
20:09.385 --> 20:11.025
don't blame me, a grandmother,

300
20:11.785 --> 20:13.385
for setting aside the ties of kinship.

301
20:14.985 --> 20:16.105
Let's go back.

302
20:21.745 --> 20:25.025
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

303
20:45.865 --> 20:47.065
Maternal Grandmother, you heard everything.

304
20:47.905 --> 20:49.585
Grandmother is cruel and vicious.

305
20:49.665 --> 20:51.145
She has disowned me.

306
20:54.545 --> 20:55.625
Kneel.

307
20:58.745 --> 20:59.825
Kneel!

308
21:00.745 --> 21:04.185
Tell me what you did honestly.

309
21:06.945 --> 21:09.185
-Kneel. -I didn't do anything wrong. Why should I?

310
21:11.345 --> 21:14.185
Lu Zhuo was seriously injured and was going to die.

311
21:14.265 --> 21:16.385
The Lus kept forcing me to get married.

312
21:16.465 --> 21:19.145
I didn't want to become a widow so I found myself a substitute.

313
21:20.305 --> 21:22.425
Later, Lu Zhuo survived by luck.

314
21:22.505 --> 21:25.025
That wretch clung to her status and wouldn't return the position.

315
21:25.105 --> 21:26.905
Why can't I kill her?

316
21:28.465 --> 21:31.905
How dare a lowly peasant stand against me?

317
21:34.625 --> 21:35.505
Maternal Grandmother.

318
21:36.145 --> 21:37.865
You're so domineering and willful.

319
21:37.945 --> 21:40.865
How are you anything like your mother?

320
21:40.945 --> 21:43.345
Maternal Grandmother, you're so unfair.

321
21:46.545 --> 21:50.465
Mother didn't want to become a widow, so you asked her to marry someone else.

322
21:51.265 --> 21:53.225
You even praised her courage.

323
21:53.305 --> 21:55.585
How come it's wrong when I do the same?

324
21:55.665 --> 21:57.985
What? She shouldn't have to be my father's widow,

325
21:58.065 --> 21:59.465
but I have to be Lu Zhuo's widow?

326
21:59.545 --> 22:01.065
You…

327
22:01.145 --> 22:03.745
Maternal Grandmother. Calm down.

328
22:04.345 --> 22:06.065
Rao is ignorant and reckless.

329
22:06.145 --> 22:07.225
She needs to be punished.

330
22:07.825 --> 22:10.545
But the important thing now isn't getting angry at her,

331
22:10.625 --> 22:13.545
but to plan for her future.

332
22:17.865 --> 22:18.785
Keep talking.

333
22:21.585 --> 22:24.585
Maternal Grandmother, I spoke with the wretch.

334
22:25.265 --> 22:28.025
She is cunning and calculative.

335
22:28.105 --> 22:30.585
Her flattering words gained the Duchess' favor.

336
22:31.105 --> 22:31.985
Even Lord Lu was…

337
22:33.345 --> 22:34.985
He was bewitched by her.

338
22:35.505 --> 22:38.305
In a few days, she established a foothold at the Duke's Residence.

339
22:38.905 --> 22:40.385
She's certainly no pushover.

340
22:40.985 --> 22:43.745
However, Old Madam Wei won't stand up for Rao to protect her reputation.

341
22:44.865 --> 22:46.025
After this grave mistake,

342
22:46.105 --> 22:48.905
there is no choice but to ask Aunt in the palace to…

343
22:48.985 --> 22:50.185
Shut up!

344
22:51.305 --> 22:54.305
Your aunt isn't the one in control of the harem.

345
22:54.385 --> 22:56.745
Do you want her to go against the Empress Dowager's decree?

346
22:57.345 --> 22:59.105
Her own daughter committed an atrocity.

347
22:59.185 --> 23:01.745
You're practically giving them a knife to use against you.

348
23:04.265 --> 23:06.625
Maternal Grandmother, you should send a message to Mother

349
23:06.705 --> 23:10.065
so she won't be fooled by an impostor and treat her like her own daughter.

350
23:13.465 --> 23:14.905
What a tragedy.

351
23:14.985 --> 23:19.465
Your reckless actions last night have probably given them a heads-up.

352
23:20.465 --> 23:24.065
Do not act recklessly anymore unless you have a foolproof plan.

353
23:24.145 --> 23:26.785
The palace is full of prying eyes.

354
23:26.865 --> 23:29.425
We must be cautious when sending messages.

355
23:29.505 --> 23:32.225
I will find a way. Let's wait for an opportunity.

356
23:32.905 --> 23:34.065
-I… -Rao.

357
23:34.665 --> 23:36.305
We'll listen to you.

358
23:46.985 --> 23:48.185
We don't need you here anymore.

359
23:48.265 --> 23:49.385
You're dismissed.

360
23:49.465 --> 23:53.345
His Lordship ordered us to watch Her Ladyship take her medicine.

361
23:53.425 --> 23:54.705
I dare not go against his order.

362
24:01.345 --> 24:02.745
Here, My Lady.

363
24:11.505 --> 24:13.505
My Lady, have a candied fruit.

364
24:23.745 --> 24:25.385
My Lady, your stomach is in pain.

365
24:25.465 --> 24:27.425
Why did you go through with the Nuo dance?

366
24:28.265 --> 24:31.225
You were the victor and received all the praise.

367
24:31.825 --> 24:34.025
Why are you still upset?

368
24:35.705 --> 24:36.705
It's too quiet.

369
24:39.505 --> 24:40.505
I'm afraid.

370
24:41.305 --> 24:42.545
What are you afraid of?

371
24:43.185 --> 24:45.185
The calm before the storm.

372
24:53.505 --> 24:54.345
Bitao.

373
24:55.065 --> 24:56.945
There's something on my mind.

374
24:57.545 --> 25:00.665
If you can't decide what to do, what then?

375
25:01.625 --> 25:03.705
My Lady, what about tossing bamboo tokens?

376
25:08.905 --> 25:12.465
If they land on different sides, what you want can be done.

377
25:12.545 --> 25:15.385
If both land on the dark side, it's forbidden by Heaven.

378
25:15.465 --> 25:18.105
If both land on the bright side, you have to do it again.

379
25:18.185 --> 25:20.065
What do you want to ask, My Lady?

380
25:21.345 --> 25:24.945
Lord Lu is arrogant and suspicious.

381
25:25.465 --> 25:27.185
He kept testing me. A real handful.

382
25:32.345 --> 25:34.425
The capital is full of nobles.

383
25:35.265 --> 25:37.425
He is not the only one I can rely on.

384
25:38.985 --> 25:40.625
I want to ask Heaven.

385
25:42.665 --> 25:44.705
Is it possible to rely on someone else?

386
25:53.065 --> 25:54.985
My Lady, they both land on the dark side.

387
25:55.065 --> 25:56.145
Heaven says it's not viable.

388
25:56.225 --> 25:57.825
It's impossible.

389
26:00.625 --> 26:02.465
Heaven says no.

390
26:04.625 --> 26:06.065
But I say otherwise.

391
26:18.585 --> 26:19.825
Be careful.

392
26:19.905 --> 26:21.065
-Here. I will take it. -Okay.

393
26:21.665 --> 26:22.785
Be careful.

394
26:22.865 --> 26:23.785
What's going on?

395
26:23.865 --> 26:25.425
Who told you to move all of these?

396
26:26.025 --> 26:28.505
Put them back. Put all of them back.

397
26:31.385 --> 26:33.545
My Lord. Old Madam says

398
26:33.625 --> 26:36.105
a newly married couple cannot live separately for too long.

399
26:36.705 --> 26:39.825
If people start talking, it'll also be a disgrace for Her Ladyship.

400
26:39.905 --> 26:43.105
Old Madam asks you to move back to the inner quarters.

401
26:44.385 --> 26:45.745
That won't do.

402
26:45.825 --> 26:47.305
Lord Lu isn't fully recovered yet.

403
26:48.065 --> 26:51.225
The physician ordered him to abstain from carnal pleasures strictly.

404
26:51.985 --> 26:53.505
My Lord, am I right?

405
26:55.825 --> 26:57.185
I understand.

406
26:57.265 --> 26:59.505
You hear that? Pack up everything.

407
26:59.585 --> 27:00.985
Be careful.

408
27:01.065 --> 27:04.305
Don't be clumsy and damage His Lordship's military scrolls.

409
27:04.385 --> 27:05.545
‎Got it.

410
27:32.545 --> 27:34.265
I didn't mean to doubt you.

411
27:37.385 --> 27:39.105
I heard reports from the servants

412
27:39.625 --> 27:43.225
that you tossed the Han family's gift for some unknown reason.

413
27:43.865 --> 27:45.465
Also the secret meeting with your cousin.

414
27:46.465 --> 27:48.025
I was worried that other people might find out

415
27:48.545 --> 27:50.145
and gossip about it.

416
27:50.665 --> 27:51.785
It would make you upset.

417
27:54.185 --> 27:55.745
I didn't mean to test you,

418
27:58.145 --> 27:59.665
much less hurt you.

419
28:17.985 --> 28:20.945
If you don't like it, I won't question any further.

420
28:21.545 --> 28:23.265
However, the time limit of one or two years,

421
28:24.105 --> 28:25.785
don't bring it up so casually anymore.

422
28:25.865 --> 28:29.905
If my grandmother finds out, it is bound to cause a huge uproar.

423
28:30.945 --> 28:32.785
Grandmother had someone move my belongings here.

424
28:33.385 --> 28:34.545
I'll ask them

425
28:34.625 --> 28:36.465
to move all my stuff to the adjacent room.

426
28:37.265 --> 28:38.385
I'll be staying over there.

427
28:46.705 --> 28:47.545
Wei Rao?

428
28:55.665 --> 28:56.905
Servants!

429
28:58.385 --> 29:00.865
My Lord, General Qi is here to pay a sick visit.

430
29:00.945 --> 29:02.785
Her Ladyship is greeting him at Jiangyun Hall now.

431
29:03.785 --> 29:05.465
JIANGYUN HALL

432
29:05.545 --> 29:08.185
The Zhongwan pressure point

433
29:08.705 --> 29:10.385
is located in the upper abdomen, roughly one,

434
29:10.465 --> 29:13.185
two, three, four inches above.

435
29:13.265 --> 29:16.225
I understand now after your demonstration, General Qi.

436
29:34.265 --> 29:35.745
What's going on in here?

437
29:35.825 --> 29:36.785
It's all smoky and stifling.

438
29:37.665 --> 29:40.185
Anyone who didn't know would think there's a fire in here.

439
29:41.985 --> 29:43.425
Lady Wei Rao has a stomach problem

440
29:43.505 --> 29:45.225
must be a weak constitution,

441
29:45.305 --> 29:46.265
made worse by the cold.

442
29:46.945 --> 29:49.145
I'm teaching Bitao to use a moxibustion stick to treat the Zhongwan,

443
29:49.225 --> 29:50.625
Liangmen, and Zusanli points.

444
29:50.705 --> 29:52.545
She only needs the treatment every other day.

445
29:53.065 --> 29:54.145
It'll be beneficial for her.

446
29:55.225 --> 29:58.025
You even know her maid's name?

447
30:00.305 --> 30:01.705
I've known you for so many years,

448
30:02.665 --> 30:04.625
but I didn't know you knew moxibustion.

449
30:04.705 --> 30:06.385
Little food and medicine back at the frontier.

450
30:06.465 --> 30:07.505
What we lacked most were physicians.

451
30:08.185 --> 30:11.025
I've treated wounds for you and the soldiers.

452
30:11.545 --> 30:13.345
This is nothing much for me.

453
30:15.265 --> 30:17.065
From your mistress's complexion,

454
30:17.145 --> 30:19.025
too much cold, raw food. Her qi is insufficient.

455
30:19.105 --> 30:20.585
She should cut down on noodles.

456
30:20.665 --> 30:21.905
It's bad for digestion.

457
30:22.665 --> 30:25.145
If she can't have rice on its own, you can steam it with sweet dates.

458
30:26.025 --> 30:27.225
I understand.

459
30:28.465 --> 30:31.785
You haven't told me where the Liangmen and Zusanli points are located.

460
30:32.585 --> 30:34.185
Why did you stop?

461
30:35.785 --> 30:36.665
Also on the upper abdomen.

462
30:38.585 --> 30:40.705
Look. This is the Liangmen pressure point.

463
30:44.825 --> 30:46.025
This is the Zusanli point.

464
30:51.465 --> 30:52.665
My Lord, what do you want?

465
30:55.185 --> 30:56.345
This is a small room.

466
30:56.425 --> 30:58.665
What if you're choked by the moxibustion smoke?

467
31:11.545 --> 31:12.385
All of you, leave.

468
31:19.065 --> 31:21.065
What? Did you two argue?

469
31:21.705 --> 31:24.105
General Qi, you are close to Lord Lu.

470
31:24.185 --> 31:25.625
Tell me.

471
31:26.265 --> 31:31.585
Why would a husband refuse to open up to his wife?

472
31:32.105 --> 31:35.705
No matter how hard I beg, he will not communicate with me.

473
31:36.305 --> 31:39.065
And why would he sleep in a different room and ignore me?

474
31:39.665 --> 31:41.865
When I accidentally touch his hand,

475
31:41.945 --> 31:43.305
he will be enraged

476
31:43.825 --> 31:46.305
as if I'm infected with the plague and will transmit it to him.

477
31:47.425 --> 31:49.785
You are the one who knows him best.

478
31:49.865 --> 31:51.345
Please enlighten me.

479
31:51.945 --> 31:56.505
Am I so hideous and vulgar that I'm not worth a glance?

480
31:57.105 --> 31:59.145
Naturally, you're… very pretty.

481
32:00.865 --> 32:03.745
However, Lu Zhuo is someone who doesn't show his feelings.

482
32:05.305 --> 32:06.305
Don't take it to heart.

483
32:07.905 --> 32:11.945
Perhaps he hates me and dislikes everything about me.

484
32:13.225 --> 32:15.105
It's all the fault of useless generals like you.

485
32:16.105 --> 32:17.945
I really hate that war.

486
32:18.025 --> 32:21.105
It ties up two people who hate each other.

487
32:22.145 --> 32:24.345
My life has been ruined.

488
32:39.545 --> 32:40.785
I don't know how to comfort you.

489
32:41.465 --> 32:42.985
Whatever I say will be wrong now.

490
32:44.225 --> 32:45.105
Please accept my apology.

491
32:54.705 --> 32:56.265
Who needs your apology?

492
32:56.945 --> 32:59.625
Is it also your fault that he hates me?

493
33:00.945 --> 33:02.785
In the future, if you are upset with anything,

494
33:02.865 --> 33:03.785
just tell me.

495
33:04.425 --> 33:07.265
If I can be of your service, I will never refuse.

496
33:07.345 --> 33:10.065
GALAXY OF VERSES

497
33:10.145 --> 33:11.625
It's my own misfortune.

498
33:12.425 --> 33:13.985
Who are you to me?

499
33:14.065 --> 33:15.905
I dare not ask you to serve me.

500
33:17.185 --> 33:19.905
Leave. Never return again.

501
33:20.425 --> 33:21.905
I also get angry when I see you.

502
33:24.825 --> 33:26.265
Lady Wei Rao, take care.

503
33:32.225 --> 33:33.225
Why didn't you address me as sister-in-law?

504
33:36.785 --> 33:38.065
How rude.

505
34:21.105 --> 34:23.824
Eating rice with soup is bad for your illness.

506
34:24.425 --> 34:25.784
Old habits die hard.

507
34:33.705 --> 34:36.385
Don't you have anything to say to me?

508
34:36.985 --> 34:38.625
No chatting while dining.

509
34:39.385 --> 34:41.225
I'm not trying to control your behavior,

510
34:41.744 --> 34:43.385
but Qi Zhongkai is an outsider.

511
34:43.465 --> 34:45.025
I've taken a fancy to your good friend.

512
34:46.385 --> 34:47.225
What did you say?

513
34:50.824 --> 34:54.705
I'm telling you that I fancy Qi Zhongkai.

514
34:58.065 --> 34:59.305
A married woman

515
34:59.385 --> 35:01.545
saying something like that before her husband.

516
35:01.625 --> 35:02.905
How dare you?

517
35:03.505 --> 35:04.905
Why not?

518
35:04.985 --> 35:06.265
I'm rather ignorant.

519
35:06.865 --> 35:07.705
I knew that your mother was in a rush

520
35:07.785 --> 35:09.385
to marry someone else after your father passed away,

521
35:09.905 --> 35:11.425
but I didn't expect you to outdo her.

522
35:12.025 --> 35:13.665
You've been married for a mere two months,

523
35:13.745 --> 35:15.105
and you already set your eye on another man.

524
35:15.185 --> 35:17.105
Your husband is still alive!

525
35:17.185 --> 35:18.025
You…

526
35:22.145 --> 35:23.545
Shameless!

527
35:24.345 --> 35:27.025
I only married into the Lu family for the auspicious match.

528
35:28.225 --> 35:30.065
Your cousin came to fetch the bride.

529
35:30.145 --> 35:31.305
I went through the ritual with a rooster.

530
35:32.185 --> 35:34.785
Later, you even refused to take me as your wife.

531
35:34.865 --> 35:37.545
I've never worshipped at your ancestral hall.

532
35:38.065 --> 35:39.145
The ritual hasn't been completed.

533
35:39.865 --> 35:41.585
I'm not considered a bride of the Lu family.

534
35:42.345 --> 35:45.225
What binds us is just a decree from the Empress Dowager.

535
35:46.345 --> 35:48.145
Yet imperial decree is inferior to human hearts.

536
35:48.745 --> 35:50.665
Marriage is determined by fate,

537
35:50.745 --> 35:51.705
never meant to be forced.

538
35:52.305 --> 35:55.745
After all, one year will go by in the blink of an eye.

539
35:56.625 --> 35:57.985
I must make plans for myself after all.

540
36:06.465 --> 36:09.385
Then, what do you plan to do?

541
36:13.865 --> 36:15.145
I heard

542
36:15.905 --> 36:17.265
you've fancied someone else for a while.

543
36:17.865 --> 36:19.945
Xie Hualou is indeed pretty and talented.

544
36:20.465 --> 36:24.065
Now, I'm willing to be the matchmaker and plan for both of you.

545
36:24.745 --> 36:27.945
In the future, when both of you marry each other,

546
36:28.625 --> 36:31.745
let's call it making up for my mistakes.

547
36:32.825 --> 36:33.665
So?

548
36:38.025 --> 36:40.465
The Xie family has been grand tutors for two dynasties.

549
36:40.545 --> 36:42.905
They would never allow their granddaughter to be someone's second wife.

550
36:42.985 --> 36:44.065
This isn't easy.

551
36:44.145 --> 36:45.745
Without my help,

552
36:45.825 --> 36:48.065
you will never be with her.

553
36:48.145 --> 36:49.145
So,

554
36:50.585 --> 36:52.225
I won't do this without getting something in return.

555
36:53.425 --> 36:56.385
You want me to matchmake you two as a middleman?

556
36:56.985 --> 36:57.945
Not at all.

557
36:58.945 --> 37:01.145
I just need you to be tolerant

558
37:02.185 --> 37:03.185
and generous.

559
37:04.265 --> 37:05.425
If you don't interfere,

560
37:06.625 --> 37:08.825
I have my own way of making this happen.

561
37:10.665 --> 37:11.505
I understand.

562
37:16.305 --> 37:17.865
Lord Lu, you don't look too well.

563
37:19.785 --> 37:20.665
What's wrong?

564
37:22.665 --> 37:23.985
Everything you said is reasonable.

565
37:24.065 --> 37:26.785
Since we are not a real couple, I can't tell you what to do.

566
37:27.385 --> 37:30.385
Your plan is perfect, but extremely difficult to execute.

567
37:31.345 --> 37:32.265
After all,

568
37:32.785 --> 37:34.585
the tongue is as sharp as a sword.

569
37:34.665 --> 37:35.745
It kills without spilling blood.

570
37:36.705 --> 37:38.665
All three families are nobles.

571
37:39.985 --> 37:41.745
Fooling around with marriage is ridiculous.

572
37:50.945 --> 37:53.985
Even if you have a plan, you need to carry it out slowly.

573
37:55.145 --> 37:58.065
Don't draw attention and act so openly.

574
37:58.145 --> 38:01.785
I will be cautious and not make myself a laughingstock.

575
38:08.425 --> 38:10.865
Thank you, my Lord, for your gracious favor.

576
38:18.185 --> 38:22.865
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

577
38:28.025 --> 38:29.265
My Lady, don't stay out.

578
38:29.345 --> 38:30.985
You might fall ill again at night.

579
38:34.665 --> 38:35.705
Why are you laughing, My Lady?

580
38:36.865 --> 38:40.425
I'm laughing because someone might get too angry to sleep tonight.

581
38:42.385 --> 38:44.905
My Lady, do you mean…

582
38:44.985 --> 38:46.825
Madam Liu used to tell me

583
38:47.625 --> 38:49.345
that that's all there is to humanity.

584
38:50.345 --> 38:52.385
People don't cherish what they get easily.

585
38:53.025 --> 38:56.785
When there's competition, even slop tastes better.

586
38:59.465 --> 39:00.425
Go to sleep.

587
39:09.145 --> 39:11.625
SONGYUE HALL

588
39:15.785 --> 39:17.225
SHIZHAI

589
39:18.705 --> 39:20.305
The wounds haven't completely healed yet.

590
39:20.385 --> 39:22.905
Yet practicing swordsmanship since midnight.

591
39:23.425 --> 39:25.385
Where's all this energy coming from?

592
39:33.665 --> 39:34.865
Zhuo.

593
39:37.105 --> 39:37.945
It's me.

594
39:42.065 --> 39:43.185
It's you?

595
39:44.105 --> 39:47.625
My eyes are blurred, and I couldn't recognize you.

596
39:50.185 --> 39:53.025
Old Madam threatened to confine you here with her life.

597
39:53.105 --> 39:55.145
I am kind enough to bring you news from court.

598
39:55.865 --> 39:57.545
Is this how you repay me?

599
39:58.585 --> 40:00.105
I've taken a fancy to your good friend.

600
40:03.705 --> 40:04.745
Zhao Song.

601
40:07.465 --> 40:09.385
Lying around all day, everything feels weak.

602
40:10.625 --> 40:11.465
Just got the itch, that's all.

603
40:12.145 --> 40:13.585
When you are fully recovered,

604
40:14.185 --> 40:15.425
I'll practice with you.

605
40:15.505 --> 40:16.585
Are the Hans attempting something again?

606
40:17.585 --> 40:18.825
You are right.

607
40:19.465 --> 40:21.465
The Hans have offered many treasures to the palace.

608
40:21.985 --> 40:23.105
They have been recorded here.

609
40:23.185 --> 40:24.705
Han Liao might be the Empress Dowager's family,

610
40:24.785 --> 40:26.265
but he's a distant relative.

611
40:26.865 --> 40:28.865
Without the Marquis of Xiting and his son's help,

612
40:29.945 --> 40:31.065
he wouldn't have climbed up the ranks so quickly.

613
40:35.785 --> 40:36.825
Jiede,

614
40:37.705 --> 40:39.585
I asked you to buy the Pig Skin Pancake.

615
40:40.145 --> 40:41.385
Did you get them?

616
40:46.865 --> 40:47.825
I sent someone to get them yesterday.

617
40:48.425 --> 40:49.585
Please give me one more day.

618
40:49.665 --> 40:50.625
I'll surely get it tomorrow.

619
40:51.625 --> 40:52.465
Pig Skin Pancake?

620
40:54.985 --> 40:57.905
The pastry Wei Rao saw at the Western Market on the night of Qixi.

621
40:58.545 --> 41:01.065
She said it was a pancake made from rice slurry.

622
41:01.145 --> 41:03.305
After drizzling hemp milk on it, its skin is as smooth as a pig's skin.

623
41:03.385 --> 41:05.985
Unfortunately, we left in a hurry and didn't buy it.

624
41:06.505 --> 41:08.745
When we came back, it was always on her mind.

625
41:11.345 --> 41:12.185
Keep searching.

626
41:12.985 --> 41:13.825
Yes.

627
41:16.825 --> 41:18.905
Pig Skin Pancake?

628
41:18.985 --> 41:22.105
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

629
41:33.465 --> 41:36.665
My Lord, General Qi left his residence and headed east.

630
41:38.705 --> 41:40.945
-East? -Yes. The people tailing him said

631
41:41.025 --> 41:42.585
he first went to the Western Market,

632
41:42.665 --> 41:43.705
before going to Liu Market.

633
41:44.305 --> 41:45.505
He seemed to be looking for something.

634
41:49.425 --> 41:51.305
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

635
41:54.785 --> 41:56.425
Both of them have feelings for each other.

636
41:57.865 --> 41:59.145
I, the husband,

637
42:00.225 --> 42:02.105
have become irrelevant.

638
42:02.825 --> 42:04.225
I'm merely an eyesore here.

639
42:04.945 --> 42:07.265
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

640
42:09.265 --> 42:10.745
It is said that the great affairs of a state

641
42:10.825 --> 42:11.745
are sacrifice and war.

642
42:11.825 --> 42:13.625
What holds true for a state holds true for a family as well.

643
42:13.705 --> 42:16.505
In the past, you were the one organizing the Mengqiu Family Mourning Ritual.

644
42:17.385 --> 42:18.305
Yesterday, Mother told me

645
42:18.985 --> 42:20.785
that hosting the ritual was the principal wife's duty.

646
42:21.465 --> 42:23.425
Mother is weak and can't handle the task.

647
42:24.025 --> 42:25.865
That's why you have had to carry the burden at such an old age.

648
42:26.465 --> 42:27.865
With a bride this year,

649
42:29.785 --> 42:30.705
Mother will have another helper.

650
42:31.305 --> 42:33.025
It is only natural for her to manage the ritual.

651
42:35.905 --> 42:37.585
Young Master, you are still young.

652
42:37.665 --> 42:38.705
You don't know what's important.

653
42:39.385 --> 42:42.465
The ritual is different from organizing Mother's birthday banquet.

654
42:42.545 --> 42:44.585
The birthday banquet is a celebratory event.

655
42:44.665 --> 42:46.865
It's fine as long as there aren't any major mistakes.

656
42:46.945 --> 42:49.265
The mourning ritual is a huge thing for the clan.

657
42:50.105 --> 42:51.785
Not only are the rules complicated,

658
42:51.865 --> 42:55.865
but hundreds of people from the clan will be watching and looking for faults.

659
42:56.465 --> 42:58.745
You better not cause trouble for your wife.

660
42:59.345 --> 43:00.545
Right.

661
43:01.065 --> 43:04.225
Wanniang. You have always been calm and unassuming.

662
43:04.305 --> 43:06.185
You don't like meddling in the clan's business.

663
43:06.265 --> 43:07.865
The children are eager for quick success.

664
43:07.945 --> 43:09.185
Can't you talk to them?

665
43:09.905 --> 43:10.745
Exactly.

666
43:13.145 --> 43:14.905
Both of you are right.

667
43:15.505 --> 43:17.745
The Mengqiu Family Mourning Ritual is a big deal.

668
43:18.345 --> 43:20.145
I dare not host it no matter what.

669
43:21.745 --> 43:22.745
Don't joke around, My Lord.

670
43:23.705 --> 43:26.865
I'm proposing this because of another reason.

671
43:28.705 --> 43:31.425
A marriage ties two families together.

672
43:31.505 --> 43:33.665
They are to honor the ancestors and carry on the family lineage.

673
43:34.345 --> 43:35.585
When a woman marries into the family,

674
43:35.665 --> 43:37.105
she must first go through the ceremony

675
43:37.185 --> 43:40.465
to get the ancestors' blessing before she can become a part of the Lu family.

676
43:42.065 --> 43:44.265
During the wedding, I was sick

677
43:44.865 --> 43:46.665
and failed to present my wife to the ancestors.

678
43:47.185 --> 43:48.345
At the time of Mengqiu Family Ritual,

679
43:49.145 --> 43:50.185
we can make up for the ancestral ceremony.

680
43:56.185 --> 44:00.065
Grandmother, Wei Rao's marriage blessed me and saved my life.

681
44:00.145 --> 44:02.185
If I made her a subject of gossip due to incomplete rites,

682
44:03.105 --> 44:04.945
the Heaven will punish me.

683
44:05.025 --> 44:08.505
Old Madam, there's no need for this.

684
44:09.025 --> 44:11.745
I dare not manage the family ritual.

685
44:12.345 --> 44:14.625
You young ones know nothing.

686
44:14.705 --> 44:17.665
A bride going through the ancestral temple ceremony

687
44:17.745 --> 44:19.705
is more important than greeting the aunts and uncles.

688
44:19.785 --> 44:24.505
Once a bride bows to the ancestors, it's set in stone.

689
44:25.185 --> 44:29.025
You will be the Lu family's principal wife,

690
44:29.105 --> 44:32.385
the Duke's Residence's future lady of the house.

691
44:33.905 --> 44:36.105
Rao, you hear that?

692
44:36.185 --> 44:39.945
Lu Zhuo is the eldest son, the pillar of the family.

693
44:40.025 --> 44:42.185
He will inherit the duke's title in the future.

694
44:42.265 --> 44:44.305
You've got a heavy load on your shoulders too.

695
44:44.385 --> 44:47.105
Forget the distant ones, consider these two aunts before you.

696
44:47.985 --> 44:49.065
They might be your elders,

697
44:49.145 --> 44:51.145
But for big clan affairs

698
44:51.225 --> 44:53.465
they have to take orders from the clan matriarch.

699
44:53.545 --> 44:54.585
Right?

700
44:58.905 --> 44:59.825
Rao,

701
45:02.025 --> 45:03.225
I'll leave everything to you.

702
45:12.345 --> 45:14.425
LU'S ANCESTRAL TEMPLE

703
45:33.945 --> 45:35.505
We decided to be a fake couple.

704
45:36.265 --> 45:38.025
Why must you go through with the temple ceremony?

705
45:38.625 --> 45:39.865
So much trouble, for nothing

706
45:39.945 --> 45:41.305
It will not end well in future.

707
45:45.945 --> 45:49.225
An old saying goes, "if the title isn't right, nothing you say carries weight."

708
45:50.305 --> 45:53.625
Even if you're the principal wife for just a month and not a year,

709
45:53.705 --> 45:54.745
managing the household,

710
45:54.825 --> 45:56.385
attending to guests and keeping servants in check

711
45:56.465 --> 45:57.745
are no easy tasks.

712
45:57.825 --> 45:58.705
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

713
45:58.785 --> 46:01.345
Wei Rao. My mother is gentle and meek,

714
46:01.425 --> 46:02.745
but not good at managing people

715
46:02.825 --> 46:04.945
I hope you can be a capable wife by my side

716
46:05.025 --> 46:06.705
to keep my aunts in check.

717
46:07.745 --> 46:09.025
How can you do that without a proper title?

718
46:09.785 --> 46:10.825
That's all?

719
46:14.145 --> 46:15.665
What else can it be?

720
46:17.345 --> 46:18.425
No need to be so distrustful.

721
46:19.025 --> 46:20.625
When it's time to part ways, we do it.

722
46:21.145 --> 46:22.345
I, Lu Zhuo, am a man of my word.

723
46:23.345 --> 46:24.865
I won't force you to stay for any longer.

724
46:27.665 --> 46:29.225
Don't worry.

725
46:29.305 --> 46:30.185
Your work won't be for nothing.

726
46:30.785 --> 46:32.705
Grandmother promised you ten thousand taels of dowry.

727
46:32.785 --> 46:35.585
A year later, I'll carry out her promise.

728
46:36.465 --> 46:37.865
I don't want your jewelry.

729
46:42.185 --> 46:44.945
Do you want people to laugh and say

730
46:45.545 --> 46:48.745
the Lu family's bride cannot even be allowed

731
46:49.945 --> 46:50.985
to pray at the ancestral temple?

732
46:51.065 --> 46:52.105
You…

733
46:57.425 --> 46:58.505
Fine, go ahead.

734
47:04.665 --> 47:06.185
A gentleman's promise must be kept.

735
47:06.265 --> 47:07.745
You must keep your word.

736
47:08.905 --> 47:09.825
Don't worry.

737
47:12.665 --> 47:14.105
Everyone, be careful.

738
47:46.665 --> 47:48.865
What? She's not in again?

739
47:48.945 --> 47:50.665
General, she's really not in.

740
47:51.265 --> 47:53.185
Lady Wei Rao wants to eat Pig Skin Pancake.

741
47:53.265 --> 47:54.945
I searched every market to find it

742
47:55.025 --> 47:56.345
and so it wouldn't go cold,

743
47:56.425 --> 47:57.905
I brought someone here to make it.

744
47:58.425 --> 48:00.105
Three days in a row, not a sign of her.

745
48:01.105 --> 48:02.185
Tell me honestly.

746
48:02.745 --> 48:04.065
Did you send my message

747
48:04.745 --> 48:07.265
or did Lu Zhuo purposely prevent us from meeting each other?

748
48:09.705 --> 48:11.985
-Ridiculous. -That's not it.

749
48:12.065 --> 48:13.305
The Hungry Ghost Festival is near,

750
48:13.385 --> 48:15.105
Lady Lu is busy preparing for the ritual.

751
48:15.185 --> 48:18.065
She goes out at sunrise and only returns at sunset.

752
48:18.665 --> 48:20.145
She even has to do her hair and makeup in the horse carriage.

753
48:20.225 --> 48:21.305
She is too busy to meet guests.

754
48:21.385 --> 48:24.065
Please forgive her for not meeting you.

755
48:27.025 --> 48:29.265
Fine. I'll return another day.

756
48:30.105 --> 48:31.985
Farewell, General. Take care.

757
48:32.065 --> 48:33.505
LU'S ANCESTRAL TEMPLE

758
48:33.585 --> 48:36.825
-She's out! -The bride who blessed the heir is out!

759
48:36.905 --> 48:39.945
Someone who was almost dead recovered thanks to her blessing.

760
48:40.025 --> 48:41.945
She is truly blessed.

761
48:42.025 --> 48:43.105
What are we still waiting for?

762
48:43.185 --> 48:45.545
Let's go closer to get some of her blessing.

763
48:45.625 --> 48:46.785
Let us get some of your blessing!

764
48:46.865 --> 48:47.985
Let us get some of your blessing!

765
48:48.065 --> 48:49.825
A-Chou, I'm here!

766
48:49.905 --> 48:51.465
-Let us get some! -It's me!

767
48:51.545 --> 48:52.865
It's me, A-Chou!

768
48:54.305 --> 48:55.345
A-Chou!

769
48:55.865 --> 48:58.225
A-Chou! Over here, A-Chou!

770
48:58.305 --> 48:59.825
It's me, A-Chou!

771
49:00.425 --> 49:01.905
I'm here!

772
49:01.985 --> 49:03.505
-It's me! -Madam!

773
49:04.225 --> 49:05.905
-A-Chou! -Wei Rao.

774
49:07.665 --> 49:09.025
It's me, A-Chou!

775
49:09.625 --> 49:11.465
-A-Chou! -Madam!

776
49:11.545 --> 49:12.745
A-Chou!

777
49:13.265 --> 49:14.745
It's me, A-Chou!

778
49:15.265 --> 49:16.825
A-Chou!

779
49:16.905 --> 49:18.025
Let us have some blessings!

780
49:18.105 --> 49:19.265
-A-Chou! -Let us have some!

781
49:19.345 --> 49:20.185
A-Chou!

782
49:21.345 --> 49:22.185
It's me!

783
49:22.265 --> 49:23.625
A-Chou!

784
49:23.705 --> 49:24.665
I'm here!

785
49:25.505 --> 49:27.025
-It's me, A-Chou! -Don't worry, My Lady.

786
49:27.105 --> 49:28.945
-Madam! -A-Chou!

787
49:29.825 --> 49:31.145
A-Chou!

788
49:31.225 --> 49:32.065
Get lost!

789
49:38.625 --> 49:40.425
Come take a look inside.

790
49:40.505 --> 49:41.465
-Hold it. -Come inside.

791
49:44.385 --> 49:45.545
Her Ladyship has ordered

792
49:45.625 --> 49:48.905
to find the beggar from just now without causing a scene.

793
49:51.745 --> 49:52.745
I don't know.

794
49:52.825 --> 49:53.785
I haven't seen him.

795
49:53.865 --> 49:55.985
‎-Come and have a look. ‎-These are quite fresh.

796
49:56.065 --> 49:57.545
‎Good.

797
50:08.625 --> 50:10.145
A-Chou's really made it.

798
50:11.585 --> 50:14.465
She lives a better life than the deities!

799
50:17.745 --> 50:21.025
Tell me. Why didn't she share all this fortune with us?

800
50:21.625 --> 50:22.945
Don't speak nonsense.

801
50:23.465 --> 50:25.905
Ma is very ill, and we've spent all our money.

802
50:25.985 --> 50:27.505
That is why we took the risk to return and find A-Chou.

803
50:28.105 --> 50:29.385
Did she say when we can meet her?

804
50:29.465 --> 50:30.905
Mother's illness cannot wait.

805
50:32.465 --> 50:35.025
I'm late. Sorry for making you wait.

806
50:36.905 --> 50:37.745
Forgive me.

807
50:46.305 --> 50:47.385
Where is my sister?

808
50:47.465 --> 50:48.985
Why isn't she coming to meet us?

809
50:49.545 --> 50:51.665
Your sister is now the wife of the heir.

810
50:51.745 --> 50:53.025
She is busy because of her duties.

811
50:53.745 --> 50:57.865
However, she still cares for you and told me to take care of you.

812
50:59.225 --> 51:00.225
Someone.

813
51:12.465 --> 51:13.505
Quick.

814
51:16.305 --> 51:18.185
I'm very close to your sister.

815
51:18.705 --> 51:21.025
I'll treat her mother like my own,

816
51:21.905 --> 51:25.265
and her siblings like my own.

817
51:25.345 --> 51:26.945
I've called a famous physician for you, Madam.

818
51:27.025 --> 51:28.305
He will be here after the meal.

819
51:28.385 --> 51:30.945
All of you just need to live here with peace of mind.

820
51:31.025 --> 51:33.465
If you need anything, just let me know.

821
51:34.065 --> 51:34.905
Please.

822
51:38.225 --> 51:40.465
Since you are A-Chou's friend, we are a family.

823
51:40.545 --> 51:42.585
Come. Sit down. Let's eat.

824
51:54.465 --> 51:55.465
Wei Rao.

825
51:55.985 --> 51:58.585
I will treat them well for you.

826
51:59.625 --> 52:02.025
The person I saw outside the temple that day.

827
52:02.105 --> 52:04.305
Ask Liangcai to keep an eye in the city.

828
52:04.385 --> 52:05.865
Report to me if he finds anything.

829
52:05.945 --> 52:06.945
I understand.

830
52:08.705 --> 52:09.665
Foolish!

831
52:11.385 --> 52:12.705
My Lady, you are too kind.

832
52:12.785 --> 52:14.425
How can you not punish such clumsiness?

833
52:14.505 --> 52:16.385
It's improper if others see this.

834
52:21.305 --> 52:22.425
A-Chou, is this nice?

835
52:27.065 --> 52:29.265
My Lady, to know more about the red string's owner,

836
52:29.865 --> 52:32.465
come to Triumph Tavern at three-quarters past the hour of Wei.

837
52:32.545 --> 52:34.825
Arrive late, and we won't be waiting.

838
54:56.305 --> 54:58.625
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
